  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">传统建筑安全</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">BUG太多</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">管理效率低</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">传统的视频监控依赖于人工监控，缺乏先进的视频分析算法，处理人员工作量大，容易遗漏，历史数据无法有效挖掘和利用。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">警示不到位</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">在传统的安全中，人员进出的方式是刷手机（NFC）以及员工智能卡，门禁通行智能化水平不足，没有越界警示和区域入侵识别，无法对多次试图闯入大楼的可疑人员进行联动报警。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">处理速度慢</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">视频监控设备问题无法预警，人工检查无法在第一时间发现问题，发现问题后无法及时响应。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">子系统联动，结合人工智能</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">智能安全天候保护</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">传统的安全是将摄像头与终端显示设备连接起来，供安保人员在安保室内查看，应用场景和功能相对单一。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">智能安全将视频监控、入侵报警、门禁、访客、消防等子系统有机联动，全天候保护，24小时自动监控各区域情况。视频监控与人工智能的结合可以消除人为因素造成的遗漏，真正实现实时监控和干预。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">应用人工智能能力</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">通过人工智能智能视频技术实现监控自动化和自动跟踪目标。系统具有人脸识别、行为分析、智能跟踪、场景分析、目标检测、图像增强等功能，可应用于身份识别、交通验证、区域权限验证等场景，判断是否有人进入禁区，实现视频内容的深入分析和理解，使“人民防空”电子化，减轻监控人员的压力，提高监控效率。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">联动报警推送</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">智能安全系统联动报警，通过人工智能智能技术识别异常事件，根据用户定制的报警规则，通过短信、APP、工作台、声光提醒等方式推送报警，实现通知，帮助安保人员更快、全面、准确地识别和响应各种异常事件，降低劳动力成本，提高安全保障。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">应用人员轨迹数据</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">智能安全系统的整个过程都是在线的。人工智能人脸识别人像数据库与人员信息数据库权限联动，自动更新人像。通过人脸控制、大门、门禁、停车等信息汇总人员在园区的行动轨迹，可以在申请权限后查看和掌握轨迹信息。此外，还可以联动考勤，降低人工成本，提高考勤效率。所有沉淀的交通数据均可追溯、数据分析和挖掘，提高运营管理效率。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#6